---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">SOLO GHOST</p>
      <h1>Independent research and engineering in wireless communication systems.</h1>
      <p class="hero-description">
        Wireless PHY - Signal Processing - Adaptive Receivers - AI-Native Communication
      </p>
      <p class="hero-thesis">
        Exploring how physical and statistical structure can be exploited
        to build more adaptive wireless receivers.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="research-section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="section-label">RESEARCH</p>
      <h2>Understanding structure before optimizing the receiver.</h2>
      <p>
        Solo Ghost investigates structure-aware and mobility-aware approaches
        to wireless communication, with a focus on channel acquisition,
        channel estimation, receiver design, equalization and signal detection.
      </p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/research/">Explore research -&gt;</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="artifacts-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="section-label">ENGINEERING ARTIFACTS</p>
          <h2>Executable work, not just ideas.</h2>
          <p class="section-intro">
            Reproducible engineering experiments that turn wireless
            communication concepts into executable simulations and technical artifacts.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a class="text-link" href="/artifacts/">View artifacts -&gt;</a>
      </div>

      <div class="artifact-grid">
        <article class="artifact-card">
          <p class="card-number">01</p>
          <h3>Discrete-Time Wireless Signal Intuition</h3>
          <p>
            CFO, sampling and phase accumulation explored through
            reproducible Python experiments.
          </p>
          <span class="card-meta">RELEASED</span>
        </article>

        <article class="artifact-card">
          <p class="card-number">02</p>
          <h3>Matched Filter &amp; Packet Detection</h3>
          <p>
            A reproducible engineering simulation of packet detection
            under controlled discrete-time AWGN conditions.
          </p>
          <span class="card-meta">RELEASED</span>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ip-section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="section-label">INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY</p>
      <h2>Five patent applications filed.</h2>
      <p>
        Solo Ghost's IP portfolio covers original work in adaptive channel
        acquisition, mobility-aware channel estimation, structure-aware
        equalization and adaptive receiver processing.
      </p>
      <p class="ip-note">Public descriptions are intentionally kept at a high level.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/ip/">Explore intellectual property -&gt;</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="notes-section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="section-label">TECHNICAL NOTES</p>
      <h2>Reasoning in public.</h2>
      <p>
        Technical notes document experiments, observations and engineering
        reasoning across wireless PHY, signal processing, synchronization,
        mobility and receiver design.
      </p>

      <div class="topic-grid">
        <div class="topic">
          <span class="topic-label">SYNCHRONIZATION</span>
          <p>Discrete-time signals, CFO and phase accumulation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="topic">
          <span class="topic-label">MOBILITY</span>
          <p>Doppler, temporal correlation and channel evolution.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="topic">
          <span class="topic-label">RECEIVERS</span>
          <p>Estimation, equalization and signal detection.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a class="text-link" href="/notes/">Read technical notes -&gt;</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="applications-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="section-label">POTENTIAL APPLICATION DOMAINS</p>
          <h2>The same underlying problems appear across demanding wireless environments.</h2>
          <p class="section-intro">
            Research directions extend beyond any single network architecture
            or deployment model.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="application-grid">
        <article class="application-card">
          <span class="application-number">01</span>
          <h3>UAV / Aerial Communications</h3>
          <p>
            High mobility, rapidly changing channels and Doppler create
            challenging receiver conditions.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="application-card">
          <span class="application-number">02</span>
          <h3>NTN / Satellite</h3>
          <p>
            Long propagation paths, mobility, Doppler and constrained
            communication resources create demanding estimation problems.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="application-card">
          <span class="application-number">03</span>
          <h3>5G / 6G / Private Networks</h3>
          <p>
            Adaptive and structure-aware processing can potentially improve
            robustness and efficiency in evolving wireless environments.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="application-card">
          <span class="application-number">04</span>
          <h3>Radar / Sensing</h3>
          <p>
            Motion, Doppler, structure and limited measurements create
            related signal-processing and estimation challenges.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <p class="application-note">
        Research directions and potential application domains; not representations
        of current products or deployed systems.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="future-section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="section-label">DIRECTION</p>
      <h2>Building toward AI-native wireless receivers.</h2>
      <p>
        Solo Ghost is developing a software-first research and engineering
        foundation for adaptive, structure-aware and eventually AI-native
        communication systems.
      </p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/research/">Follow the research -&gt;</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="evidence-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="evidence-inner">
        <div>
          <p class="section-label">FOLLOW THE WORK</p>
          <h2>Research, code and engineering evidence.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="evidence-links">
          <a href="https://github.com/haripriyap/doppler-coherence-analysis" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
          <a href="/artifacts/">Engineering Artifacts</a>
          <a href="/notes/">Technical Notes</a>
          <a href="/ip/">IP Portfolio</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 128px 0 116px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .hero-inner {
    max-width: 940px;
  }

  .eyebrow,
  .section-label,
  .card-number,
  .card-meta,
  .topic-label,
  .application-number {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .eyebrow,
  .section-label {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 920px;
    margin: 22px 0 30px;
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 5.5rem);
    line-height: 1.01;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .hero-description {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .hero-thesis {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 26px 0 0;
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .research-section,
  .artifacts-section,
  .ip-section,
  .notes-section,
  .applications-section,
  .future-section,
  .evidence-section {
    padding: 112px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .narrow {
    max-width: var(--content-width);
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 14px 0 22px;
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3vw, 2.8rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    font-weight: 560;
  }

  .narrow > p:not(.section-label) {
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .text-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 22px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .section-heading {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: end;
    gap: 48px;
    margin-bottom: 42px;
  }

  .section-heading h2 {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .section-intro {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .artifact-grid,
  .application-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--line);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .artifact-card,
  .application-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 36px;
  }

  .artifact-card {
    min-height: 310px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .card-number {
    margin: 0 0 62px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .artifact-card h3,
  .application-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .artifact-card p,
  .application-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 500px;
  }

  .card-meta {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 30px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .ip-note {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .topic-grid {
    margin-top: 46px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--line);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .topic {
    min-height: 180px;
    padding: 28px;
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .topic-label {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .topic p {
    margin: 22px 0 0;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .application-card {
    min-height: 230px;
  }

  .application-number {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .application-note {
    margin: 24px 0 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .future-section {
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .future-section h2 {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .evidence-section {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .evidence-inner {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: end;
    gap: 48px;
  }

  .evidence-inner h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .evidence-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: 18px 28px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .section-heading,
    .evidence-inner {
      display: block;
    }

    .section-heading .text-link,
    .evidence-links {
      margin-top: 24px;
    }

    .evidence-links {
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }

    .topic-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .hero {
      padding: 86px 0 78px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 13vw, 4rem);
    }

    .research-section,
    .artifacts-section,
    .ip-section,
    .notes-section,
    .applications-section,
    .future-section,
    .evidence-section {
      padding: 78px 0;
    }

    .artifact-grid,
    .application-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .artifact-card,
    .application-card {
      min-height: 0;
    }

    .card-number {
      margin-bottom: 42px;
    }

    .application-number {
      margin-bottom: 34px;
    }
  }
</style>
